Path

File path operations.

Constructors:
  Path(string)                - Create path from string
  Path(path, append)          - Create path with appended segment

Methods:
  Read()                      - Read file contents as Data
  Write(text)                 - Write string to file
  Write(string[])             - Write lines to file
  Write(char[])               - Write char array to file
  Write(byte[])               - Write bytes to file
  List()                      - List child paths
  Move(path)                  - Move file to new path
  Remove()                    - Delete file

Operators:
  implicit string             - Convert to string path